Title: "Overview"
Id: "78c82c43-191f-4890-8c62-3a8101f2a004"

Text: "`Justified:` contains nested justification items.

```mlg-fragment
Justified:
. label: \"Axiom of Pairing\"
  by: \"ZFC\"
  comment: \"Used to construct unordered pairs.\"
```

Justification groups carry prose metadata about why a result or definition is accepted."
Id: "32b52f93-cbca-4e6f-b1eb-16cd31a5cbb5"
